{"array-and-indeterminate-binding":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Array and Indeterminate Binding</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Value binds one array item to each checkbox. IndeterminateOneWayStatePath, IsCheckedOneWayStatePath, and OnChangeFunc drive a select-all parent. InputName includes the bound state in form submission.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/checkboxInput.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.CheckboxInput(uiForm.CheckboxInputSettings{\n\tLabel:                        &#34;Select all&#34;,\n\tInputName:                    &#34;selectedFruits&#34;,\n\tIndeterminateOneWayStatePath: &#34;selectedFruits.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; selectedFruits.length &lt; fruitOptions.length&#34;,\n\tIsCheckedOneWayStatePath:     &#34;selectedFruits.length === fruitOptions.length&#34;,\n\tOnChangeFunc:                 &#34;selectedFruits = selectedFruits.length === fruitOptions.length ? [] : [...fruitOptions]&#34;,\n})\n\n@uiForm.CheckboxInput(uiForm.CheckboxInputSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Apple&#34;,\n\tInputName:       &#34;selectedFruits&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;selectedFruits&#34;,\n\tValue:           &#34;apple&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{selectedFruits: ['apple'], fruitOptions: ['apple', 'banana', 'orange']}\"> <!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"selectedFruits\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-effect=\"$el.checked = !!(selectedFruits.length === fruitOptions.length); $el.indeterminate = !!(selectedFruits.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; selectedFruits.length &lt; fruitOptions.length)\" @change=\"selectedFruits = selectedFruits.length === fruitOptions.length ? [] : [...fruitOptions]\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\" :class=\"(selectedFruits.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; selectedFruits.length &lt; fruitOptions.length ? &#39;!border-secondary-500 !text-secondary-500&#39; : &#39;&#39;)\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\" x-show=\"!(selectedFruits.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; selectedFruits.length &lt; fruitOptions.length)\"></i> <i class=\"ph-bold ph-minus text-xs\" x-show=\"selectedFruits.length &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; selectedFruits.length &lt; fruitOptions.length\"></i> </span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">Select all</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"selectedFruits\" value=\"apple\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"selectedFruits\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">apple</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"selectedFruits\" value=\"banana\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"selectedFruits\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">banana</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"selectedFruits\" value=\"orange\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"selectedFruits\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">orange</span></label> </div><p class=\"mt-1.5 rounded-md border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-100 [text-box:trim-both_cap_alphabetic]\">Values: <span x-text=\"selectedFruits\"></span></p></div></div></div>","checked-colors":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Checked Colors</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">CheckedColor paints the filled box and UncheckedColor paints the empty box. FocusRingColor colors the focus ring, and TextColor colors the label.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/checkboxInput.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.CheckboxInput(uiForm.CheckboxInputSettings{\n\tLabel: &#34;Primary&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tIsChecked:      true,\n\tCheckedColor:   &#34;primary-500&#34;,\n\tUncheckedColor: &#34;neutral-500&#34;,\n\tFocusRingColor: &#34;primary-500&#34;,\n\tTextColor:      &#34;neutral-50&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-primary-500 peer-checked:border-primary-500 peer-checked:text-primary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-primary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">Primary</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-emerald-500 peer-checked:border-emerald-500 peer-checked:text-emerald-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-emerald-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">Emerald</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-emerald-500 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-emerald-400\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-300 \">Emerald outline</span></label> </div></div></div></div>","error-states":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Error States</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">IsInvalid shows the error style and ErrorMessage explains it. ErrorColor paints the error style, IsInvalidOneWayStatePath drives the error from Alpine state, and ErrorMessageOneWayStatePath prints the message from it.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/checkboxInput.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.CheckboxInput(uiForm.CheckboxInputSettings{\n\tLabel: &#34;Accept the terms&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tInputId:                     &#34;checkbox-demo-terms&#34;,\n\tIsInvalid:                   true,\n\tErrorMessage:                &#34;You must accept the terms to continue.&#34;,\n\tErrorColor:                  &#34;orange-500&#34;,\n\tIsInvalidOneWayStatePath:    &#34;!hasAcceptedTerms&#34;,\n\tErrorMessageOneWayStatePath: &#34;errorMessage&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{isCheckboxExampleEnabled: false, errorMessage: 'Checking the box clears this error.'}\"><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"checkbox-demo-terms\" aria-describedby=\"checkbox-demo-terms-error\" aria-invalid=\"true\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-orange-500 peer-checked:border-orange-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">Accept the terms</span></label> <span id=\"checkbox-demo-terms-error\" class=\"text-xs text-orange-500\">You must accept the terms to continue.</span></div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" :aria-invalid=\"!isCheckboxExampleEnabled\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\" :class=\"(!isCheckboxExampleEnabled ? &#39;!border-red-500 !peer-checked:border-red-500&#39; : &#39;&#39;)\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">Accept the terms (bound error)</span></label> <span class=\"text-xs text-red-500\" x-show=\"!isCheckboxExampleEnabled\" x-text=\"errorMessage\"></span></div></div></div></div>","label-position":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Label Position</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">LabelPosition places the label on the left or the right of the checkbox.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/checkboxInput.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.CheckboxInput(uiForm.CheckboxInputSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Accept the terms&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;hasAcceptedTerms&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tLabelPosition: uiForm.CheckboxInputLabelPositionLeft,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{isCheckboxExampleEnabled: false}\"><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2 flex-row-reverse cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">Label on the left</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">Label on the right</span></label> </div></div></div></div>","shapes":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Shapes</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Shape rounds the checkbox frame: square, rounded, or circular.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/checkboxInput.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.CheckboxInput(uiForm.CheckboxInputSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Accept the terms&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;hasAcceptedTerms&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tShape: uiToolset.ShapeRounded,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{isCheckboxExampleEnabled: false}\"><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded-none border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">square</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">rounded</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded-full border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">circular</span></label> </div></div></div></div>","sizes":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Sizes</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Size scales the checkbox and its label: xs, sm, md, lg, or xl.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/checkboxInput.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.CheckboxInput(uiForm.CheckboxInputSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Accept the terms&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;hasAcceptedTerms&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tSize: uiForm.CheckboxInputSizeMd,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{isCheckboxExampleEnabled: false}\"><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-[0.5rem]\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-50 \">xs</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-4 w-4 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-[0.625rem]\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-50 \">sm</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-5 w-5 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-xs\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-50 \">md</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-6 w-6 rounded border-neutral-50/20 peer-enabled:peer-hover:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:border-secondary-500 peer-checked:text-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-sm\"></i></span> <span class=\"text-base text-neutral-50 \">lg</span></label> </div><!-- CheckboxInput --><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1\"><label class=\"relative inline-flex w-fit select-none items-center gap-2  cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer absolute inset-0 h-full w-full cursor-pointer opacity-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\" x-model=\"isCheckboxExampleEnabled\"> <span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-2 bg-transparent text-transparent transition-colors h-7 w-7 rounded border